@baseUrl = http://localhost:5282
@bookingId = 1

### Create a booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Avery Jones",
  "checkInDate": "2026-07-10T15:00:00-05:00",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-07-12T11:00:00-05:00",
  "roomType": "Deluxe"
}

### Get a booking
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Accept: application/json

### Get bookings overlapping a date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/between?startDate=2026-07-11T00%3A00%3A00-05%3A00&endDate=2026-07-13T00%3A00%3A00-05%3A00
Accept: application/json

### Update a booking
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Avery Jones",
  "checkInDate": "2026-07-11T15:00:00-05:00",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-07-13T11:00:00-05:00",
  "roomType": "Suite"
}

### Cancel a booking
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}

### Missing booking returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/999999
Accept: application/json
